    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/9d728f0a86ec5bc9f67efc5156761f6e.avif?t=1750788242\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something smells funny around here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Niko wakes up after a long night of partying to discovers that something is stinking up his neighborhood. As he investigates he stumbles upon a story of corruption that sends him down a path with more than he bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover all the secrets. Fight your way through the mean critters as you learn all the truths. Snag some cool trinkets to enhance your abilities. And laugh along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f61d950066a680fbef7829c40407db50.avif?t=1750788242\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedy focused adventure! Beat up foes with your hammer. Use 3 different super attacks to unleash hell. Grab your plunger and use it to climb to new heights - or smack your enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wacky cast of characters all with even bigger personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Trinkets! Buy or find trinkets that unlock new powers and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Niko in multiple different unlockable player skins. And with no microtransactions! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/9d728f0a86ec5bc9f67efc5156761f6e.avif?t=1750788242\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something smells funny around here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Niko wakes up after a long night of partying to discovers that something is stinking up his neighborhood. As he investigates he stumbles upon a story of corruption that sends him down a path with more than he bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and discover all the secrets. Fight your way through the mean critters as you learn all the truths. Snag some cool trinkets to enhance your abilities. And laugh along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/7db99e6d783d69b9220fc493872f9889.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f61d950066a680fbef7829c40407db50.avif?t=1750788242\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/f235b251f6c6880a227e14da2edc3fb9.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedy focused adventure! Beat up foes with your hammer. Use 3 different super attacks to unleash hell. Grab your plunger and use it to climb to new heights - or smack your enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wacky cast of characters all with even bigger personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Trinkets! Buy or find trinkets that unlock new powers and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Niko in multiple different unlockable player skins. And with no microtransactions! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.poster.avif?t=1750788242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.webm?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532010/extras/d8907b48fba74e8a0534febcdfc025c8.mp4?t=1750788242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
